  "label": "Racist Metaphor of Slavery",
  "description": "The meme employs a racist metaphor by equating Black people with enslaved Africans and using the visual of ants (often stereotyped as primitive or animal-like) to reinforce the idea that Black people are inherently inferior or suited for servitude. This metaphor is rooted in the historical legacy of slavery and is used to normalize or justify racial prejudice.",
